('cisco-investments', 'Cisco Investments', 'vc', 'Venture capital investment firm', 'Venture capital investment firm. It focuses on areas such as silicon and optics, cloud, collaboration, security, and enterprise networking. The firm provides portfolio companies with access to its sales and marketing resources, global customer base, and industry expertise. This support extends throughout the investment lifecycle, including assistance with operations and commercialization. The investment strategy prioritizes ventures with strong potential for strategic alignment and financial returns. A global network of experts facilitates collaboration and innovation.', 'https://www.ciscoinvestments.com', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'CVC', '', '', '', 'Alon Weinberg (Director); Jon Koplin (Managing Director); Tyson Li (Managing Director); Rajiv Menon (Managing Director)', '', '', 12.94857, 77.59617, '', 'live'),
('creaegis', 'Creaegis', 'vc', 'Venture capital firm investing in multiple sectors', 'Venture capital firm investing in multiple sectors. Company offers investment in consumer, financial services, healthcare, and technology sectors.', 'http://creaegis.in', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'VC Funds', '', '', '2018', 'Prasad Ramaswamy (CFO); Sambasivam Kailasam (Partner); Nitish Bandi (Partner); Prakash Parthasarathy (Founder & Managing Partner)', '', '', 12.94589, 77.56488, '', 'live'),
