('ideaspring-capital', 'Ideaspring Capital', 'vc', 'Venture capital firm focused on technologies in the B2B enterprise space', 'Venture capital firm focused on technologies in the B2B enterprise space. The company invests in the seed or Pre-Series A-stages with ticket sizes. It is focused on deep tech, blockchain, biosciences, and Web 3.0 sectors.', 'https://www.ideaspringcap.com', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'VC Funds', '', 'Seed to Series A', '2016', 'PV Boccasam (Limited Partner & Advisor); Naganand Doraswamy (Founder & Managing Partner); Arihant Patni (Managing Diretor & Venture Partner); Suryaprakash Konanuru (CTO)', '', '', 13.01886, 77.56183, '', 'live'),
